---

---

<div class="pr-1 pl-1 mb-24" id="about">
  <div class="flex justify-between flex-col md:flex-row">
    <div
      id="one"
      class="md:w-4/5 flex-col justify-between p-4 leading-normal w-auto mr-20"
    >
      <h5 class="mb-2 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">Hi,</h5>
      <p class="mb-3 text-gray-600" id="m1">
        I'm Ronak Hingonia, a versatile software engineer from Jaipur, India. <p
          class="text-gray-500 mb-3"
        >
          In a world driven by constant change, I am driven by my passion for
          new technologies, constantly seeking to understand and contribute to
          their potential.💪🏻
        </p>
        <p class="mb-2">
          My primary tools of choice includes:
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
            <li>JavaScript / TypeScript</li>
            <li>Python</li>
            <li>
              <span>Go</span>
              <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 italic"> (learning) </span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span>Google Cloud Platform</span>
              <span>
                <img
                  src="/2810941.png"
                  alt="GCP Logo"
                  class="inline-block w-6 h-6 align-middle"
                />
              </span>
            </li>
            <li>React/Next</li>
            <li>Astro</li>
            <li>
              <span>Node.js</span>
              <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 italic">
                (I prefer Bun though)
              </span>
              <a href="https://bun.sh/" target="_blank">
                <img
                  src="/bun.svg"
                  alt="Bun Logo"
                  class="inline-block w-6 h-6 align-middle"
                /></a
              >
            </li>
            <li>
              <span>Express</span><span class="text-sm text-gray-500 italic">
                (<!-- //<sup> ly</sup> -->~~ Elysia)
              </span>
              <a href="https://elysiajs.com/" target="_blank">
                <img
                  src="/elysia.svg"
                  alt="Elysia logo"
                  class="inline-block w-5 h-5 align-middle"
                /></a
              >
            </li>
            <li>MongoDB</li>
            <li>MySQL</li>
            <li>Tailwind</li>
          </ul>
        </p>
      </p>
    </div>
    <div
      id="now"
      class="md:w-1/4 border border-gray-500 rounded-lg shadow-sm mt-8 p-5 h-40 w-auto"
    >
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
        <p class="font-normal text-gray-600">Now</p>
        <div class="relative inline-flex">
          <span
            class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-green-400 opacity-75"
          ></span>
          <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-green-500"
          ></span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-gray-400 mb-3" style="font-size: 9px">What's that?</p>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">Probably learning something new :)</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div id="interest" class="justify-between mt-4 text-center h-auto">
    <hr />
    <p class="mt-4">
      Alongside development, I have a strong interest in Computer & Network
      Security. Currently revising the online textbook <span class="book"
        >CS 161: Computer Security</span
      >. Try giving it a visit: <u
        ><a href="https://textbook.cs161.org/">https://textbook.cs161.org/</a
        ></u
      >♥.
    </p>
    <br />
    <hr />
    <br />
  </div>
  <div
    id="education"
    class="h-40 w-full border-gray-300 rounded-lg shadow-sm border flex justify-between mt-2"
  >
    <div class="p-5">
      <h5 class="text-xl text-black opacity-90 tracking-tight">
        Indian Institute of Technology Gandhinagar <span
          style="font-size: 10px"
          class="text-gray-500">(2020-2024)</span
        >
      </h5>
      <br />
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4">
        Material Science and Engineering (majors)
      </p>

      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">
        Computer Science and Engineering (minors)
      </p>
    </div>
    <div id="logo" class="flex justify-center items-center">
      <img src="/Logo.svg" alt="IIT-GN Logo" class="object-cover w-48" />
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="flex items-center justify-center mt-12 w-full">
    <hr class="flex-grow border-gray-300" />
    <p class="text-gray-500 font-kalam text-center">
      Feel free to reach out to me if you have any projects in mind, or just to
      say hello.👋
    </p>
    <hr class="flex-grow border-gray-300" />
  </div>
</div>
<style>
  /* Define the animation */
  @keyframes rotateClockwise {
    0% {
      transform: rotate(0.0001deg);
    }
    100% {
      transform: rotate(360.0001deg);
    }
  }
  #logo img {
    animation: rotateClockwise 20s linear infinite;
    will-change: transform;
    transform-origin: center;
  }
  .book {
    background-image: linear-gradient(214deg, #ff4500, #ff7300);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }

  @keyframes glow {
    0% {
      box-shadow: 0 0 5px #4ade80;
    }
    50% {
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px #4ade80;
    }
    100% {
      box-shadow: 0 0 5px #4ade80;
    }
  }
  .glow-dot {
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    background-color: #4ade80;
    border-radius: 50%;
    animation: glow 2s infinite;
  }
  @media screen and (max-width: 639px) {
    #education {
      height: 16rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }
    #one {
      width: 100%;
    }
    #interest {
      margin-top: 4rem;
    }
  }
  @media screen and (min-width: 640px) and (max-width: 780px) {
    #education {
      height: 11rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }
  }
  @media screen and (min-width: 781px) and (max-width: 840px) {
    #education {
      height: 12rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }
  }
  @media screen and (min-width: 841px) and (max-width: 920px) {
    #education {
      height: 11rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }
  }
  @media screen and (min-width: 921px) and (max-width: 1025px) {
    #education {
      height: 10rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }
  }
  @media (min-width: 1026px) and (max-width: 1200px) {
    #education {
      height: 12rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
